re ed intanto esplora le dimore della sua prigione. Un segreto oscuro e triste, purtroppo, si cela nella storia della Bestia: Belle è l'unica che può salvarlo; l'unica che può restituirgli la libertà e l'amore.","poster":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/d164513f-0fee-4bea-8dd9-533b6efaa4d9.webp"},"background":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/cdc4bb46-8f5d-495a-9c11-1ef9b053f2af.webp"},"rating":6.319,"cast":[{"id":1925,"name":"Vincent Cassel","role":"The Beast","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ivUQfhn5olOmR5hthN8C8GThBV4.jpg"},{"id":121529,"name":"Léa Seydoux","role":"Belle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4q6xqqWLLleQrFjeqeYYV8B0fwE.jpg"},{"id":18177,"name":"André Dussollier","role":"Belle's Father","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rw3J5sNFr7VYvTKAPak9d14F7R6.jpg"},{"id":17093,"name":"Eduardo Noriega","role":"Perducas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wL2pCdw5lNsDrWRor3rxwLaSTQK.jpg"},{"id":1282702,"name":"Myriam Charleins","role":"Astrid","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jk3CKz5ouuUUMTD3TqkPBTWpSkc.jpg"},{"id":130664,"name":"Audrey Lamy","role":"Anne","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zRyuaPykapMI71yH6cPunGY5Ywz.jpg"},{"id":237881,"name":"Sara Giraudeau","role":"Clotilde","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tPjI1YgAgWMYRHpPfyqpRrOynbL.jpg"},{"id":142694,"name":"Jonathan Demurger","role":"Jean-Baptiste","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vFen5Y5KXSH9m5f1UcTH1HhcHYB.jpg"},{"id":125411,"name":"Nicolas Gob","role":"Maxime","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/62PJpyKWbBbxvIbG6uRIG7K1Nfj.jpg"},{"id":1456035,"name":"Louka Meliava","role":"Tristan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cFE4LKDFNyn806oLSLrzPhgv6bY.jpg"},{"id":45625,"name":"Yvonne Catterfeld","role":"La Princesse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3PkS3TBIj2ZdkL3yeUSWo0czDty.jpg"},{"id":1365732,"name":"Dejan Bućin","role":"Louis","profile":"